  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8909a7b854c460945b7273a620ed017e, type: 3}
  m_Name: PoI_01_Susan
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: Susan
  characterAvatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 32fb296c575faff4f98e6d60a0b72a44, type: 3}
  arrivalPrompt: 'Susan, a Christchurch resident, has been to the square for many
    times. Everytime when she walks by, she looks at the sky, searching for something.
    What''s exactly is she looking for? Let''s find out. '
  arrivalButtonText: Meet Susan
  dialogueLines:
  - "My name is Susan. I grew up here in Christchurch, and it\u2019s still my home
    today."
  - Standing here in Cathedral Square now, it feels quite different from what I remember.
    The tower and spire are missing, but they hold a special place in my memory.
    You used to be able to see it from almost anywhere in the city.
  - "Back in high school, I got lost around Cathedral Square during a field trip.
    I remembered my teacher, Mr Watson, always told us: 'If you are lost, look for
    the Cathedral spire\u2014it's the tallest building in the town!' I heard the
    bell, looked up, and found my way back."
  - The last time I saw the Cathedral standing was right before the earthquake, when
    I visited the Square with my homestay student, Wen. We had no idea how much that
    ordinary afternoon would come to mean to us.
  - "Now, when I pass by here, I still see the absence of that spire... I always
    try to look up as I used to, and outline its contours in my mind \u2014 it's
    a habit that never left me."
  - "Even when you weren\u2019t standing right next to it, knowing where the Cathedral
    was helped you find your bearings. I suppose it was always a part of how I remember
    Christchurch."
  voiceClips:
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: fd1ceef2f6577334db1e3cf18a9d8e11, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 54f53d9c4e6619d4f8040b960f951c6c, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6aa361a7422f98f43ac57d9aef3ac882, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 049b8b87d25e9f34ea3a7b1647631674, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 97294186df02df54abfc8056a4826ed5, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1def5b0233171c641abe4c31884dace0, type: 3}
  alignmentPrompt: "Point your camera to the Cathedral site, and observe what used
    to stand here in the Square. \nYou can choose 2D historical and 3D model to observe.
    \nSlide the bar to adjust the opacity of historical photos. "
  alignmentButtonText: Okay
  interactionInstruction: 
  interactionButtonText: Got it
  reflectionPrompt: 'Now, put down your tablet and take a moment to look around Cathedral
    Square.


    Think about what you have just experienced: What did the Cathedral
    mean to the people who lived in this city?'
  reflectionButtonText: Continue
